---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Currently Building - Nivedita Pandey" description="A live view of what Nivedita Pandey is building - Dendrons.ai products, applied AI agents, and the problems she is actively pursuing.">
  <div class="building-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Currently Building</h1>
      <p class="page-description">
        A live view of what's in progress - problems I'm pursuing, products in use, and agents I've built for my own work.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Problems -->
    <section class="building-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Problems</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">The questions I keep returning to.</p>
      <ul class="problem-list">
        <li>How do organisations actually become AI-ready - not through training alone, but through systems, governance, and institutional capacity?</li>
        <li>How do you extract meaningful signal from markets and media at scale, and make it actionable for people without research teams?</li>
        <li>Can one person, properly tooled with AI agents, operate at the leverage of a small team?</li>
        <li>What does it mean to build AI tools responsibly when you are both the designer and the first user?</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Products -->
    <section class="building-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Products</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Tools built for others to use.</p>
      <div class="product-grid">

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">MirrorMirror.life</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">Personality assessment built on narrative psychology. Tells you something true about yourself that standard tests miss.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://mirrormirror.life" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">getHeard Voice</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live · via Dendrons.ai</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">AI-powered market research. Structured qualitative insight at the speed and cost of a survey.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">getHeard Pulse</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live · via Dendrons.ai</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">Media monitoring and signal extraction. Know what is being said, what it means, and what to do about it.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">getBookings</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live · via Dendrons.ai</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">Revenue operations automation. Reduces the manual overhead between pipeline and closed revenue.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">Compass aiReady</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">AI readiness across five domains, with data weighted heaviest. 20 minutes to a readiness band, data sub-score, and a 90-day plan.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://aiready.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">Compass DataReady</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">CDO-grade data readiness: quality, infrastructure, governance, security, and AI/ML. 25 minutes - mapped to DAMA-DMBOK, NIST AI RMF, DPDP, and GDPR.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://dataready.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">Compass GovernReady</h3>
            <span class="product-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">AI governance audit against RBI, DPDP, MAS FEAT, SR 11-7, FCA, and the EU AI Act. 30 minutes to a board-ready gap analysis and 90-day remediation roadmap.</p>
          <a class="product-link" href="https://compass.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card product-card--soon">
          <div class="product-card-top">
            <h3 class="product-name">Agentic Commerce Suite</h3>
            <span class="product-status product-status--soon">Launching Soon</span>
          </div>
          <p class="product-description">AI search is rewriting who gets found. Three products - RankReady, TransactReady, TrustReady - for businesses that need to rank in AI search, transact with agentic buyers, and stay compliant.</p>
          <span class="product-link product-link--muted">Waitlist open via Dendrons.ai</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Personal Agents -->
    <section class="building-section building-section--last">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Personal Agents</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Tools built for my own workflows. They work. I use them daily. Not yet productized - but that may change.</p>
      <div class="agent-list">

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">VERNE <span class="agent-sub">built on NanoClaw</span></h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Personal AI assistant built on NanoClaw, an open-source framework I forked and extended. The customisation layer - memory management, WhatsApp and web interfaces, and my specific daily workflows - is what became VERNE.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="/verne/">Know more →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">Arsène</h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Task management agent. I forward emails to it and it builds and maintains a Kanban board of what needs doing. Keeps incoming chaos organised without manual triage.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="https://arsene.niveditapandey.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Know more →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">Thoth AI</h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Form-filling agent, named after the Egyptian scribe-god. Handles repetitive documentation and application workflows.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="https://thoth.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Know more →</a>
        </div>

      </div>
      <p class="section-footer">
        These tools are built for my own work. If you are interested in the code, the approach, or exploring a productized version - <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .building-page {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .page-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .building-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .building-section--last {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .section-intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* Problems */
  .problem-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .problem-list li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Products */
  .product-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .product-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .product-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .product-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .product-status {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .product-description {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .product-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .product-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .product-link--muted {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .product-status--soon {
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .product-card--soon {
    border-style: dashed;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Personal Agents */
  .agent-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .agent-item {
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .agent-item:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .agent-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .agent-sub {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .agent-description {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .agent-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .agent-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .section-footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .section-footer a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .section-footer a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .product-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
